<title>SINGAPORE: Ho Wah Genting tops actives and gainers.</title>
<headline>Ho Wah Genting tops actives and gainers.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision engineering service firm Ho Wah Genting topped the actives and led gainers in late afternoon trade in Singapore on Friday.</p>
<p>At 0800 GMT, its share price was at S$1.36, up S$0.41, on 4.6 million shares.  </p>
<p>Some dealers attributed the gain to rumours that the company was a takeover target.</p>
<p>But others felt that was unlikely since the share price of its parent firm, Ho Wah Genting Bhd in Malaysia was stable at 15.10 ringgit, down 10 sen on 39,000 shares.</p>
<p>Company officials declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080) at jn</p>
